1
00:00:00,080 --> 00:00:03,394
Benny: Cluck... I mean, I'll barricade the
door with a sofa!

2
00:00:03,714 --> 00:00:08,973
BUS-E: Ding dong! This is the Last Bus,
Route twelve. Part five of ten: the sofa.

3
00:00:09,293 --> 00:00:12,022
Priya: Benny. How many windows does this
motel have?

4
00:00:12,342 --> 00:00:15,569
Benny: One big sofa. One big door. Math.

5
00:00:15,689 --> 00:00:18,503
Priya: And eleven windows. More math.

6
00:00:18,823 --> 00:00:21,319
Dante: ...Eleven windows is a lot of math.

7
00:00:21,639 --> 00:00:25,442
Rosa: Sleepy Motel. One door. Eleven
windows.

8
00:00:25,762 --> 00:00:27,416
Dante: Benny. Push the sofa!

9
00:00:27,536 --> 00:00:29,106
Benny: Cluck... I mean, pushing!

10
00:00:29,426 --> 00:00:31,618
Benny: Window! Window! Another window!

11
00:00:31,738 --> 00:00:32,948
Dante: ...Eleven is a lot.

12
00:00:33,268 --> 00:00:36,099
Teddy: Gary says zombies are not shy. They
use windows.

13
00:00:36,419 --> 00:00:40,834
Priya: Real rule. Block every entrance,
not just the big one.

14
00:00:41,154 --> 00:00:43,264
Steve: Excuse me. Do you have a room?

15
00:00:43,384 --> 00:00:45,198
Rosa: Sorry, Steve. We're full.

16
00:00:45,518 --> 00:00:47,458
Benny: I lost a sofa and my dignity.

17
00:00:47,778 --> 00:00:48,738
Lena: You had dignity?

18
00:00:49,378 --> 00:00:53,366
BUS-E: Steve's ticket says: admit one.
Fare: free. Cozy!

19
00:00:53,686 --> 00:01:01,186
BUS-E: Part five of ten, the Last Bus,
Route twelve. Next: the helicopter. Follow for part six.

